README
------

* BasicSearch.java
  Demonstrates how to search an array for a value

* BinarySearch.java
  Demonstrates how to run a binary search for a value in an array

* BinarySearchBuiltin.java
  Demonstrates how to run a binary search for a value in an array

* BinarySearchRecursive.java
  Demonstrates how to run a binary search for a value in an array
  as a recursive version
